sequenceDiagram
    actor Staff
    participant Browser
    participant MVC as PaymentController
    participant Svc as PaymentService
    participant UoW as UnitOfWork
    participant DB as SQL Server

    Staff->>Browser: Open Payment/Index(patientId)
    Browser->>MVC: GET Index
    MVC->>Svc: GetBillingPage(patientId)
    Svc->>DB: SELECT Patient BillingAccount Payments Appointments
    Svc-->>MVC: BillingPageViewModel
    MVC-->>Browser: Financials page

    opt Update billing account
        Staff->>Browser: Submit SaveBilling form
        Browser->>MVC: POST SaveBilling
        MVC->>Svc: TrySaveBilling(model)
        Svc->>DB: UPDATE PatientBillingAccounts
        MVC-->>Browser: Redirect with success message
    end

    Staff->>Browser: Submit RecordPayment form
    Browser->>MVC: POST RecordPayment
    MVC->>MVC: Validate ModelState
    MVC->>Svc: TryRecordPayment(model)

    alt Payment validation failed
        Svc-->>MVC: error message
        MVC-->>Browser: Redirect with error
    else Payment recorded
        Svc->>UoW: Add Payment entity
        UoW->>DB: INSERT Payments
        Svc->>DB: UPDATE billing balance if applicable
        DB-->>Svc: payment Id
        Svc-->>MVC: success
        MVC-->>Browser: Redirect Payment/Index
        Browser-->>Staff: Updated balance and payment history
    end

    Staff->>Browser: Open payment receipt
    Browser->>MVC: GET Receipt(paymentId)
    MVC->>Svc: GetPaymentReceipt(paymentId)
    Svc->>DB: SELECT Payment with Patient Appointment
    Svc-->>MVC: ReceiptViewModel
    MVC-->>Browser: Receipt view
